                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "VBox.arrange and HBox.arrange measure world bounds and reposition objects without creating a parent. Use them for objects that appear one at a time. New VBox/HBox create an Entity container and re-layout their children when added or removed. Use a container when the composition should move or fade together."
        },
        {
          "type": "example",
          "example": "labs/pg-layoutscene"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "arrange-many-items",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 2,
