              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "example",
                  "example": "labs/pg-layout-morph"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Arrange replicates a template over a line, grid, volume lattice, radial layout or curve. CPU mode gives individual scene entities and per-item APIs; GPU mode uses Instanced storage and shared geometry. Choose CPU mode for heterogeneous child interactions and GPU mode for repeated geometry with many instances. Changing a template’s topology is different from changing per-instance position or color."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Exact contracts: [Arrange](/api-entities-layout#arrange), [Instanced](/api-entities#instanced)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "fit-the-camera",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Fit the camera"
        },
        {
          "type": "tabs",
          "tabs": [
            {
              "label": "Frame the subjects",
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "example",
                  "example": "labs/pg-camera-frame"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Camera.frame accepts entities, an AABB or points. It computes bounds, aspect-aware distance or orthographic scale, optional orientation and focal distance. Empty bounds produce no usable framing transform. ComputeFrameTransform calculates a result without applying it, which is useful when constructing a camera animation."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Camera.frame is immediate. There is no current Camera.frameAnimated method. Animate camera.position or use camera animations; a 2D controller provides zoomToFit with its own seconds-based transition semantics."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Exact contracts: [VBox](/api-entities-layout#vbox), [HBox](/api-entities-layout#hbox), [Camera](/api-camera#camera), [Camera2DController](/api-camera#camera2dcontroller)."
        }
      ]
    },
